# The server image carries server/, src/, and data's JSON (item 5's seventh step): no art, no fonts, no docs, no
# screenshots, no tools. A world under Node reads JSON alone (server/boot.js; assets.setHeadless).
*
!server/
!src/
!data/
!package.json
data/**/*.png
data/**/*.webp
data/**/*.jpg
data/**/*.gif
data/**/*.ttf
data/**/*.md
data/**/*.txt
